1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,869
How far can an agent evolve for fifteen cents?

2
00:00:04,783 --> 00:00:11,688
In this decision-agent demo, the same model improved its average evaluation score from eighty-four to one hundred.

3
00:00:12,575 --> 00:00:17,121
A procurement decision depends on conflicting reports and revised rules.

4
00:00:17,163 --> 00:00:21,029
Miss the source records, and the conclusion can change.

5
00:00:21,992 --> 00:00:25,288
Turn business problems into an evaluation set.

6
00:00:25,329 --> 00:00:28,426
Run a baseline to expose the weaknesses.

7
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:32,013
Procurement scored just fifty-seven.

8
00:00:32,055 --> 00:00:36,787
The gap was in evidence retrieval, version checks and calculations.

9
00:00:37,742 --> 00:00:42,423
PenguinHarness uses the failure trace to improve the agent’s working method.

10
00:00:43,325 --> 00:00:49,677
Retrieve the evidence, identify the current rules, recalculate the numbers, then make the decision.

11
00:00:50,575 --> 00:00:52,657
The model stayed the same.

12
00:00:52,699 --> 00:00:57,706
The agent configuration changed; the evaluation materials did not.

13
00:00:58,658 --> 00:01:02,747
On retesting, procurement rose from fifty-seven to one hundred.

14
00:01:02,789 --> 00:01:05,886
The average improved by sixteen points.

15
00:01:06,825 --> 00:01:14,716
Including the baseline, optimization, scoring and six test runs, estimated model-call cost was about fifteen cents.

16
00:01:15,617 --> 00:01:18,275
Track each attempt in the cost center.

17
00:01:18,317 --> 00:01:22,532
Low costs make repeated testing and iteration more accessible.

18
00:01:23,492 --> 00:01:32,620
On the published coding benchmark, PenguinHarness matched Codex at seventy-one point two five percent accuracy, for about one fifty-eighth the cost.

19
00:01:33,533 --> 00:01:40,150
Connect evaluations, memory, tools and applications, so improvements return to the business.

20
00:01:41,033 --> 00:01:42,719
PenguinHarness.

21
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:46,925
Building the most comprehensive platform for agent self-evolution.

22
00:01:46,967 --> 00:01:50,857
Download the app, or start with the open-source repository.
